// #59: a handshake whose SYN was retransmitted gives no RTT sample without
// timestamps, so the RTO falls back to 3 s (RFC 6298 §5.7, tcp_init_metrics).
0      connect 192.0.2.2:80
+0     > S 0:0(0) <mss 1460,sackOK,nop,nop,TS val ? ecr 0,nop,wscale 8,eol>
+1     > S 0:0(0) <mss 1460,sackOK,nop,nop,TS val ? ecr 0,nop,wscale 8,eol>
+0.1   < S. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 4000 <mss 1460>
+0     > . 1:1(0) ack 1
+0     send 100
+0     > P. 1:101(100) ack 1
+2.99  status 1
+0.01  > P. 1:101(100) ack 1
